title: "Automated Detection of Satellite Trails in Astronomical Images"
abstract: >-
  Replication and extension of the Stoppa et al. (2024) U-Net + Hough satellite-trail
  detection pipeline on a MeerLICHT image subset, with architectural, error-characterisation,
  training-protocol, and inference-time extensions.
